{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":1014770,"name":"NightRain","username":"NightRain","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/df705f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-11-04T02:21:30.320Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e我开了一个最新版的kimi max 套餐，在kimi k3.1-pro 模型出来以后，基本一直在用这个模型，用了一段时间以后，对 这个模型的用量做了一个大致的估算\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e我使用的是 paseo + omp provider ，选用 kimi k3.1-pro 做为模型进行使用\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/11/04/1793758882121.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"332\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/11/04/1793758882710.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"257\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/11/04/1793758882898.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"130\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n以此来计算，kimi 最新的max套餐，使用 kimi-k3.1pro 的话，能用大概48亿的token ，平均到每周5天，每天大概能用 2.4亿的token ，感觉耐用性上升了很多，目前在开发方面的体验感觉与gpt5.6sol 没太大区别（gpt6以后的模型我都没用过，因为风控降智）\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":17,"updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:21:30.320Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":106583,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"NightRain","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":35,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/106583/1","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":